+// the offending attribute, one line further down, so the suppressions no longer
+// cover them and the file fails. `@ts-nocheck` restores the suppression upstream
+// intended, and matches what the sibling `dialog.tsx` in this same package
+// already does. Inference is unaffected, so consumers see the same types.
+//
+// Remove this patch when @ladle/react ships declarations rather than source, or
+// relocates its own suppressions.
